          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "94C17C7A84111304",
      "text": "People all around the world know who the one\\nand only MC of RIP is...[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "94C17F7A8411181D",
      "text": "so you got a lotta nerve havin’ me fly all the\\nway here for a ghostly guest verse! Hahaha![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "94C17E7A8411166A",
      "text": "I’m just kiddin’. If a Champion like you calls with\\na nice offer, you know I’m pickin’ up![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "94C1797A84110DEB",
      "text": "So you want me to treat these Blueberry kids to a\\nlyrical lesson? I’m ready![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "901D6A3D4A970823",
      "text": "Give ’em some bars, please!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "901D6B3D4A9709D6",
      "text": "No bars—just battling, please!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "94C1787A84110C38",
      "text": "Hah! You’re down to go with the flow, huh, kid?\\c\\nDon’t worry—I’ll teach ’em a lesson on how to\\nbattle, too![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "D5CC122E68F7FCEE",
      "text": "Hahaha! Don’t sweat it, kid. The school of Ryme’s\\nnot takin’ new students—I’m here for battlin’![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "3E5BB372E8A75448",
      "text": "These Blueberry kids are big into Double Battles,\\nhuh?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "3E5BB472E8A755FB",
      "text": "Same goes for me. Double Battles are deep!\\nThey make you think from different angles![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "3E5BB572E8A757AE",
      "text": "Two Pokémon dropping moves together like\\nthey’re tradin’ bars—that’s my kind of battle![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "50FA35A9A0FBE382",
      "text": "Interesting",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "50FA34A9A0FBE1CF",
      "text": "Heck yeah!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "3E5BB672E8A75961",
      "text": "“Interesting?” Hah! You talk like you’ve never\\ndone a Double Battle before![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_03b",
      "hash64": "9D300841545C4019",
      "text": "Hah! Oh, you already know, baby![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "3E5BB772E8A75B14",
      "text": "I’m all for more people bein’ into Double Battles.\\nIt means more chances for me to shine![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "3E5BB872E8A75CC7",
      "text": "So I’m gonna teach these Blueberry babies how\\nthe grown-ups do bone-rattlin’ Double Battles![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "6726A9679DCCFF19",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Hey, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]—relax a minute\\nand\\r\\ntalk\\r\\nwith\\r\\nme![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BD06",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "6726A8679DCCFD66",
      "text": "Listen, for real—I’m grateful you called me out\\nhere to Blueberryland.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "6726A7679DCCFBB3",
      "text": "I get mad energy from bein’ surrounded by kids.\\nAll their spirit powers me up.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "6726A6679DCCFA00",
      "text": "You surprised to hear I like havin’ kids around?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "C6693166A7261C05",
      "text": "Blown away!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "C6692E66A72616EC",
      "text": "Nah",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "6726AD679DCD05E5",
      "text": "Hah! You and the rest of the world, baby! That’s\\nwhat happens when you’re a boss like me![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_04b",
      "hash64": "13BE2E1123606465",
      "text": "Hah! That’s sweet of you, baby. You think I look\\nlike a nice old DJ G-Randma?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "6726AC679DCD0432",
      "text": "I used to have a rough time dealin’ with kids.\\nBut ever since becoming a grandparent, I’ve\\r\\nsoftened up to those little ones.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "6726AB679DCD027F",
      "text": "You know, you’re about the same age as my\\ngrandkids. Makes this old softy’s eyes well up,\\r\\nseein’ you work so hard.[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "FB86C2822AE6FD0B",
      "text": "But this tender talk ain’t my style! I’ll leave you\\nterrified, not teary-eyed! Haha![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "FB86C1822AE6FB58",
      "text": "Time to bring the tempo back up. I know what\\nwe can do to get things hoppin’![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "FB86C4822AE70071",
      "text": "Whatcha say to some Pokémon trading,\\nLil Champ [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "FB86C3822AE6FEBE",
      "text": "I’ll trade you the one, the only: DJ G-Rave!\\nHow’s that for a drop? Show me what you got![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "FB86C6822AE703D7",
      "text": "Thanks for takin’ the plunge—that trade was fun!\\nI’ll train this one a ton till it’s grade A-1!\\c\\nFor real, I’ll take good care of it—body and soul.\\nIt’ll be a real Double Battler soon![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
