      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_cancel_00",
      "hash64": "F942D81B895D1DD9",
      "text": "You’d rather pass on this battle, huh? Thought\\nyou were more spirited than that![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
