      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_gym_ghost_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "B11B5D79BF8E2448",
      "text": "How’s DJ G-Rave doin’ on the 1s and 2s? That\\nfool loves dancin’ if you give him a beat![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
