      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Listen, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Geeta told\\nme\\r\\nsomethin’,\\r\\nbut\\r\\nI\\r\\ngotta\\r\\nmake\\r\\nsure...\\c\\nDid you tell her I’m your favorite Gym Leader?\\nFor real?!\\c\\nIf I took the time to answer every fan who said\\nI’m the greatest, I’d never get anything done...\\c\\nBut hey, coming from you, I appreciate the\\nshout-out![VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
